<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Golf-Appleby wins Honda Classic.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Golf-Appleby wins Honda Classic.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian golfer Stuart Appleby has won the Honda Classic tournament in Florida.</p>
<p>Appleby, the overnight leader, finished on 14 under par in the U.S. PGA Tour event to win by one shot from Americans Payne Stewart and Michael Bradley.</p>
<p>It was Appleby's first tournament victory in the United States and guarantees him a place in next month's U.S. Masters at Augusta.</p>
<p>--Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373 1800</p>
</text>
